    <!-- ─── 6. NEXT STEPS ─── -->
    <section class="section section-next" id="contact" aria-labelledby="next-heading">
        <h2 id="next-heading" class="section-label">What's Next</h2>
        <p class="next-paragraph">
            What's next? scale. FlashFX is entering its growth phase, with a YC interview
            on the horizon, a product that users love, and a roadmap that brings professional-grade AI
            animation tools to every creator on the planet. If you are an investor, collaborator, or
            potential partner who believes in the project, I would
            like to speak with you.
        </p>
        <p class="next-contact">
            Reach me at <a href="mailto:the.real.gabryy@gmail.com">the.real.gabryy@gmail.com</a>
        </p>

